                  }
          %p
            A cubical set is said to have
            %em connections
            if in addition it has for every
            = succeed "-cell" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
